1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,850
- He's got Amy now.
- Yeah, he does...

2
00:00:02,052 --> 00:00:04,542
(Penny:)...but it's not the same.
- Why?

3
00:00:05,856 --> 00:00:07,186
(Leonard:)Um...

4
00:00:07,925 --> 00:00:11,365
Well, all right, you know how
in Harry Potter and the Half-Blood Prince...

5
00:00:11,562 --> 00:00:14,892
(Penny:)...Ron didn't abandon Harry
because Harry started dating Ron's sister?

6
00:00:15,099 --> 00:00:17,729
(Leonard:)Harry and Ginny get together?

7
00:00:22,072 --> 00:00:26,702
(Penny:)Sorry, spoiler alert. My point is,
as much as I want to live with you...

8
00:00:26,910 --> 00:00:29,280
(Penny:)...I can't do it knowing how much
Sheldon needs you.

9
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:32,470
(Leonard:)Please. The only thing he needs me for
is to be his whipping boy.

10
00:00:32,716 --> 00:00:34,476
(Leonard:)His stooge, his doormat.

11
00:00:34,718 --> 00:00:37,448
(Penny:)Well, you know what they say,
if it ain't broke...

12
00:00:39,923 --> 00:00:43,193
(Leonard:)Wow, it sounds to me like
you don't want us to live together.

13
00:00:43,394 --> 00:00:48,794
(Penny:)No. No, no, I do. I do.
It's just... It's a really big step.

14
00:00:48,999 --> 00:00:52,459
(Leonard:)Is it? We're together all the time.
Financially, it makes great sense.

15
00:00:52,703 --> 00:00:55,763
(Leonard:)Can you think of one reason
why we shouldn't do this?

16
00:00:56,273 --> 00:00:59,023
(Penny:)Well, um...

